        "path": "/v1/device/screenshots/7d8e9f10-1112-4314-8516-171819202122/complete",
        "timestamp": 1760000789,
        "nonce": "deadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeef",
        "body": "{}",
        "expectedCanonicalRequest": "POST\n/v1/device/screenshots/7d8e9f10-1112-4314-8516-171819202122/complete\n1760000789\ndeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeefdeadbeef\n44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a",
        "expectedSignature": "2ad02bc1d8cd037ccc017a2d55f626c408d9c58a047b894781d653633378844f"
      },
      {
        "name": "path-with-percent-encoding",
        "why": "The path is used verbatim. Neither side may decode or re-encode it, or the two disagree on the bytes.",
